WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.717
This is a lower jaw with its teeth. The bone that holds them is called the ridge.

00:00:05.517 --> 00:00:08.781
After the teeth are lost, the ridge slowly shrinks, over many years.

00:00:09.581 --> 00:00:13.549
In the end, only the base of the jaw is left, low and flat at the back.

00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:18.040
A complete denture rests on the gum. On a flat ridge, it can move.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:23.939
Two implants in the front can hold the denture still. Experts agree this is a good first choice.
